# ── Flash Trade V2 MCP — environment ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Flash V2 runs on Solana MAINNET across TWO chains: trading transactions go to
# the MagicBlock Ephemeral Rollup RPC; account setup + withdrawal transactions
# go to the base-chain Solana RPC. All endpoints below have working defaults —
# you only need a keypair path if you use sign_and_send.

# Hosted V2 REST base. Default is the live root. NOTE: the live app serves the
# V2 surface at ROOT — the documented `/v2` edge prefix is not deployed. If you
# front the app with that edge, set this to https://flashapi.trade/v2.
# FLASH_API_URL=https://flashapi.trade

# Ephemeral Rollup RPC — where TRADING transactions are submitted.
# ER_RPC_URL=https://flash.magicblock.xyz

# Base-chain Solana RPC — where SETUP + WITHDRAWAL transactions are submitted.
# Use your own keyed RPC (Helius/Triton) — the public one rate-limits.
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com

# Optional: HTTP timeout in ms (default: 30000)
# FLASH_API_TIMEOUT=30000

# Optional: default owner pubkey for tools that accept one
# WALLET_PUBKEY=YOUR_WALLET_PUBKEY_HERE

# Optional: keypair for the sign_and_send tool (default: ~/.config/solana/id.json)
# KEYPAIR_PATH=/path/to/your/keypair.json
